    "type": "game",
    "name": "Across the Wonderlands",
    "steam_appid": 2597200,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/9dfba0ef9ffc4cc8750cd9f1bbf714b4.webp?t=1733491448\" width=600 height=42 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/a9e82233866f69daefe8634f8374a75e.poster.avif?t=1733491448\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/a9e82233866f69daefe8634f8374a75e.webm?t=1733491448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/a9e82233866f69daefe8634f8374a75e.mp4?t=1733491448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Dive into a sprawling, whimsical world teeming with life and wonder, drawing inspiration from the surreal charm of <strong><i>Alice in Wonderland</i></strong>, <i>The Wizard of Oz</i>, and other timeless fables. This open-world adventure is a living <strong>theme park\u00a0</strong>filled with vibrant landscapes and endless surprises to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/5ec6b4ae70b6869e78fdf17464dd4f66.webp?t=1733491448\" width=600 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/ff06758af80ca6af703835e7d088c8ae.poster.avif?t=1733491448\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/ff06758af80ca6af703835e7d088c8ae.webm?t=1733491448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/ff06758af80ca6af703835e7d088c8ae.mp4?t=1733491448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy objects to collect resources and crafting materials. Mix ingredients, even emotions, to create fearsome weapons or tasty treats on the go with our innovative <strong>slot-crafting system</strong>\u2014no recipes or stations required! Unleash creativity and chaos as every smash unlocks new possibilities for your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/a032c106420cbd10e6705e93272bc2c3.webp?t=1733491448\" width=600 height=42 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/6380524f7ee9b7361714545ba9036945.poster.avif?t=1733491448\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/6380524f7ee9b7361714545ba9036945.webm?t=1733491448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/6380524f7ee9b7361714545ba9036945.mp4?t=1733491448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Engage in <strong>playful combat</strong>, where food is your weapon of choice! Battle bizarre monsters by hurling crafted dishes at them, and watch as they react in surprising ways. Whether they\u2019re stunned by sweetness or enraged by a spicy meal, every fight is a delightful and unpredictable food fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/755f5df2e4adfa5ebbee17dbae0ae4dc.webp?t=1733491448\" width=600 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/a61f8327565a54c047909f5b4139e9ec.poster.avif?t=1733491448\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/a61f8327565a54c047909f5b4139e9ec.webm?t=1733491448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/a61f8327565a54c047909f5b4139e9ec.mp4?t=1733491448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items, seedlings, creatures, and ingredients from the mainland to upgrade and personalize your magical Briefbase. Literally,\u00a0<strong>build your skills</strong> within the base, then use the capabilities of those structures to tackle exciting challenges in the outer world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Co-op for Up to Four Players</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experience the adventure with friends in cooperative mode. Work together to navigate challenges, craft, build, and battle, making each session a unique collaborative experience. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mod Support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Comprehensive mod support embraces the community's creativity. Players can enhance their gaming experience by modifying items, creatures, environments, and more. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Community-Driven Development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your feedback and creativity drive our game's evolution. Join our community, share your ideas, and watch your suggestions come to life. Together, we'll shape an ever-evolving game experience that reflects the imaginations of our players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/02fa62929a65ac1e63f9d17c821c32ce.poster.avif?t=1733491448\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/02fa62929a65ac1e63f9d17c821c32ce.webm?t=1733491448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/02fa62929a65ac1e63f9d17c821c32ce.mp4?t=1733491448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/052744128b2115903b0b12bd0e09eba8.webp?t=1733491448\" width=600 height=49 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/9dfba0ef9ffc4cc8750cd9f1bbf714b4.webp?t=1733491448\" width=600 height=42 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/a9e82233866f69daefe8634f8374a75e.poster.avif?t=1733491448\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/a9e82233866f69daefe8634f8374a75e.webm?t=1733491448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/a9e82233866f69daefe8634f8374a75e.mp4?t=1733491448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Dive into a sprawling, whimsical world teeming with life and wonder, drawing inspiration from the surreal charm of <strong><i>Alice in Wonderland</i></strong>, <i>The Wizard of Oz</i>, and other timeless fables. This open-world adventure is a living <strong>theme park\u00a0</strong>filled with vibrant landscapes and endless surprises to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/5ec6b4ae70b6869e78fdf17464dd4f66.webp?t=1733491448\" width=600 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/ff06758af80ca6af703835e7d088c8ae.poster.avif?t=1733491448\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/ff06758af80ca6af703835e7d088c8ae.webm?t=1733491448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/ff06758af80ca6af703835e7d088c8ae.mp4?t=1733491448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy objects to collect resources and crafting materials. Mix ingredients, even emotions, to create fearsome weapons or tasty treats on the go with our innovative <strong>slot-crafting system</strong>\u2014no recipes or stations required! Unleash creativity and chaos as every smash unlocks new possibilities for your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/a032c106420cbd10e6705e93272bc2c3.webp?t=1733491448\" width=600 height=42 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/6380524f7ee9b7361714545ba9036945.poster.avif?t=1733491448\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/6380524f7ee9b7361714545ba9036945.webm?t=1733491448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/6380524f7ee9b7361714545ba9036945.mp4?t=1733491448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Engage in <strong>playful combat</strong>, where food is your weapon of choice! Battle bizarre monsters by hurling crafted dishes at them, and watch as they react in surprising ways. Whether they\u2019re stunned by sweetness or enraged by a spicy meal, every fight is a delightful and unpredictable food fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/755f5df2e4adfa5ebbee17dbae0ae4dc.webp?t=1733491448\" width=600 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/a61f8327565a54c047909f5b4139e9ec.poster.avif?t=1733491448\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/a61f8327565a54c047909f5b4139e9ec.webm?t=1733491448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/a61f8327565a54c047909f5b4139e9ec.mp4?t=1733491448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items, seedlings, creatures, and ingredients from the mainland to upgrade and personalize your magical Briefbase. Literally,\u00a0<strong>build your skills</strong> within the base, then use the capabilities of those structures to tackle exciting challenges in the outer world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Co-op for Up to Four Players</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experience the adventure with friends in cooperative mode. Work together to navigate challenges, craft, build, and battle, making each session a unique collaborative experience. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mod Support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Comprehensive mod support embraces the community's creativity. Players can enhance their gaming experience by modifying items, creatures, environments, and more. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Community-Driven Development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your feedback and creativity drive our game's evolution. Join our community, share your ideas, and watch your suggestions come to life. Together, we'll shape an ever-evolving game experience that reflects the imaginations of our players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/02fa62929a65ac1e63f9d17c821c32ce.poster.avif?t=1733491448\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/02fa62929a65ac1e63f9d17c821c32ce.webm?t=1733491448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/02fa62929a65ac1e63f9d17c821c32ce.mp4?t=1733491448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597200/extras/052744128b2115903b0b12bd0e09eba8.webp?t=1733491448\" width=600 height=49 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "The most whimsical open-world survival crafting game! Build your magical base dimension, craft bizarre dishes, and face off against quirky foes as you journey through enchanting fables to uncover the mystery of the fallen star.",
